{"2519710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snowlike", "steam_appid": 2519710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Carve your way through avalanches of critters, as you upgrade your weapons &amp; gear on the way down the mountain.</i><br><br>Part satisfying snowboarding simulation, part snowballing bullet heaven, and all dynamically interwoven with a full <i>original soundtrack of wacky bass music</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/eebd11de3de88773e89cbe8cdcd65a81.avif?t=1781812734\" width=1186 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snowboarding at it's silliest. Carve your way down endless procedurally-generated mountains &amp; survive against avalanches of enemies. Summon boss bosses, land sick tricks, and make wishes on magical snowmen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the mountain until the mountain conquers you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/aad516b97fc3e044e27409179ff8ca3f.poster.avif?t=1781812734\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/aad516b97fc3e044e27409179ff8ca3f.webm?t=1781812734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/aad516b97fc3e044e27409179ff8ca3f.mp4?t=1781812734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/4365dfa9ab4b39d40cf9dd7ab034630a.avif?t=1781812734\" width=1180 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolve your character by combining passive upgrades with auto-shoot style active abilities. Stack weapons on top of each other to create unique and deadly combinations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hula hoops, yellow snowballs, energy drinks... go wild!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/77776abc138d113b9db387accfaba48b.poster.avif?t=1781812734\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/77776abc138d113b9db387accfaba48b.webm?t=1781812734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/77776abc138d113b9db387accfaba48b.mp4?t=1781812734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/dca32b665485ba7aad60236cae0513f5.avif?t=1781812734\" width=1178 height=193 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against swarms of thousands of enemies. Powered by a new advanced system to enable blazing-fast performance, even when things get chaotic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure awaits!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/f130eb57e497204f6f9b1eced60a7836.poster.avif?t=1781812734\" width=1170 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/f130eb57e497204f6f9b1eced60a7836.webm?t=1781812734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/f130eb57e497204f6f9b1eced60a7836.mp4?t=1781812734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Collect a cast of playable characters, including...</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Snow Maker&quot;</strong> - Robot who produces a <i><strong>snowlike</strong></i> substance out of his rear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Hula Girl&quot;</strong> - Always has her hoop to damage anyone who gets to close</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Snow Suit&quot;</strong> - Tech Bro who can create lasers to zap anyone who crosses his path </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Red Witch&quot;</strong> - Summons snowballs (and a yellow snowball on critical hit) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Diamond Eyes&quot; -</strong> A clown who juggles chainsaws that slip out in random directions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Featuring an original soundtrack by solo developer. Bass music, funky garage, snow jungle, techno, and other modern grooves influenced by classic video game soundtracks of the late 90s / early 2000's.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/be354b9c0b2c65505f7b8ef44b463480.avif?t=1781812734\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras_big/be354b9c0b2c65505f7b8ef44b463480.avif?t=1781812734 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Carve your way through avalanches of critters, as you upgrade your weapons &amp; gear on the way down the mountain.</i><br><br>Part satisfying snowboarding simulation, part snowballing bullet heaven, and all dynamically interwoven with a full <i>original soundtrack of wacky bass music</i>.