></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Snow Suit&quot;</strong> - Tech Bro who can create lasers to zap anyone who crosses his path </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Red Witch&quot;</strong> - Summons snowballs (and a yellow snowball on critical hit) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Diamond Eyes&quot; -</strong> A clown who juggles chainsaws that slip out in random directions</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Featuring an original soundtrack by solo developer. Bass music, funky garage, snow jungle, techno, and other modern grooves influenced by classic video game soundtracks of the late 90s / early 2000's.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras/be354b9c0b2c65505f7b8ef44b463480.avif?t=1781812734\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/extras_big/be354b9c0b2c65505f7b8ef44b463480.avif?t=1781812734 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Snowboarding Roguelike Survival", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/af70de8a4ee310c6c8a8550e67ba24028936921d/header.jpg?t=1781812734", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/9ce857a6387e4b1f58ebad7fe4aed60318cded80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781812734", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519710/9ce857a6387e4b1f58ebad7fe4aed60318cded80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781812734", "website": "https://sandbar.studio/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Pr